    "decision_requested": "Approve submission of a priced tender for the Northgate Depot EV Charging Hub at a funding level of GBP 6.67m (including management reserve), subject to the conditions below.",
    "executive_summary": "NTA requires a turnkey depot charging hub for 40 electric buses. The bottom-up Class 3 estimate gives a budget at completion of GBP 6.35m, with risk register expected value (GBP 0.60m) close to contingency (GBP 0.56m). The critical path runs through DNO connection and energisation, which puts the 30 September 2027 Phase 1 date at risk; we recommend qualifying Phase 1 to the DNO energisation date. Two commercial terms need negotiation: unlimited data-breach liability and delay damages linked to third-party DNO works. With these qualifications, the risk profile is acceptable and the project fits our strategy for depot electrification.",
